cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite the thesis below."
title: "Digitalized Workflow of a Liquid Hydrogen Tank Integrating Thermo-Structural Analysis: model, scripts and results"
abstract: >-
  Parametric Abaqus model, requirement-derivation scripts, post-processing and
  complete results of an MSc thesis on liquid hydrogen tanks for three aircraft
  classes (Embraer E190, Airbus A320neo, Airbus A350-900). The inner wall of each
  tank is sized against yield at 1.5 bar and buckling at 0.187 bar, and analysed
  under four static load cases at five fill levels at both pressures: 120
  coupled heat transfer and static cases, plus 18 mesh-convergence cases.
